 "description": "GUI GOV — the interface governor (OFF/SLOW/PAUSE/HALT). Governs how hard the debug UI itself is allowed to work: SLOW decimates panel refresh, PAUSE freezes panel data, HALT stops UI work entirely while the sim runs on. Use it when the deck itself costs frames — the panels are diagnostics, and diagnostics must never become the disease. This governs UI only; it never touches physics."
